      "id": "seg:code:declaration:0006:0001",
      "source": "```swift\nfunc raycastQuery(from point: CGPoint, allowing target: ARRaycastQuery.Target, alignment: ARRaycastQuery.TargetAlignment) -> ARRaycastQuery?\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\nfunc raycastQuery(from point: CGPoint, allowing target: ARRaycastQuery.Target, alignment: ARRaycastQuery.TargetAlignment) -> ARRaycastQuery?\n```",
